WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.461
- Hi, my name's Zack.

00:00:01.461 --> 00:00:03.755
There's a new dating
site called Mouse Mingle

00:00:03.755 --> 00:00:05.339
where Disney fans can meet-up.

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:06.925
I'm gonna see what happens when I use

00:00:06.925 --> 00:00:09.543
actual Disney lines to
pick-up real people.

00:00:09.543 --> 00:00:12.096
You know, winter's a good
time to stay in and cuddle.

00:00:12.598 --> 00:00:13.880
It's your hairdo, right?

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.224
You've been using the dinglehopper?

00:00:15.964 --> 00:00:17.227
- What? (laughs)

00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:20.480
- I know you.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.430
I walked with you once upon a dream.

00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:24.558
- [Man in black shirt] Sure.
- [Zack] No wait.

00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:25.861
Come back.

00:00:25.861 --> 00:00:27.182
Please come back!
- [Bearded man] What's up?

00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:28.895
- [Zack] I don't even know
your name, how will I find you?

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.085
- [Bearded man] Oh, you don't need to.

00:00:30.085 --> 00:00:31.199
- Oh, okay.

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:32.783
So some people are worth melting for,

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.119
but maybe just not right this second.

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:36.112
- Oh, that's funny. (laughs)

00:00:36.709 --> 00:00:39.355
- Do you ever wonder what those
sparkly dots are up there?

00:00:39.355 --> 00:00:40.584
- What sparkly dots?

00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:42.085
- [Zack] Why do you shut me out?

00:00:42.085 --> 00:00:43.812
Why do you shut the world out?

00:00:44.202 --> 00:00:45.672
What are you so afraid of?

00:00:45.672 --> 00:00:47.089
- [Woman in red] I don't know.

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:48.540
- Join me for dinner.

00:00:49.092 --> 00:00:51.148
That was not a request!
- [Man in hoodie] What?

00:00:51.148 --> 00:00:53.013
- What do you say me
and you take a walk over

00:00:53.013 --> 00:00:54.967
to the tavern and look at my trophies?

00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:56.807
- That sounds like a good idea.

00:00:57.597 --> 00:00:58.894
- Thank you. (woman laughs)

00:00:58.894 --> 00:01:01.937
This is the day your dreams come true!

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:09.897
I'm going to be king of Pride Rock.

00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:11.284
- I don't speak English.

00:01:11.284 --> 00:01:12.616
- Oh. (man laughs)

00:01:12.616 --> 00:01:17.036
("Fantasy Dreamworld" by Audio Network)

